<http://data.gov.be/dataset/bxlcity/regional-roads> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Roads managed by the Brussels Capital Region. Some roads (streets, highways, avenues, boulevards, squares,...) are located on the territory of the City; other roads may be adjacent.\n"@en .
