<http://data.gov.be/dataset/bxlcity/social-networks> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Register (unofficial) of accounts and pages of the City of Brussels (City, departments, services, libraries, schools, other institutions, non-profit associations, actions, events) on social networks (Facebook, Twitter, Google+, LinkedIn, Pinterest, Flickr, YouTube).\n"@en .
