<http://data.gov.be/dataset/brussels/e9dfdc42-0a55-42e1-935b-b26b40b1f174> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Brussels Capital Region: location of the different stations measuring the air quality. Stations of the telemetric, non-telemetric (sampling with laboratory analysis) and weather networks are included. The measured parameters are specified for each station.\nNote :\nIn French : \nhttp://documentation.bruxellesenvironnement.be/documents/QAir_Rpt0911_corr_ssAnnexesB_C_D_E_fr.PDF\nIn Dutch :\nhttp://document.environnement.brussels/opac_css/elecfile/QAir%20Rpt0911%20ssAnn%20B%20C%20D%20E%20bis%20nl"@en .
