<http://data.gov.be/dataset/brussels/b46e1454-3d1b-4e95-b697-1af015a5a20f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Brussels-Capital Region : location of the different groundwater quality monitoring sites managed by Brussels Environment (IBGE-BIM) and which results are transmitted through the reporting to Europe (under Article 8 of the Water Framework Directive). Indication of the analyzed water body, the European Code and the Brussels code of the monitoring site. Distinction between two types of monitoring: surveillance monitoring for all groundwater bodies (type_monitoring = 1) and operational monitoring for groundwater bodies identified as being at risk of failing to achieve the objectives of good status (type_monitoring = 2)"@en .
<http://data.gov.be/dataset/brussels/b46e1454-3d1b-4e95-b697-1af015a5a20f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "b46e1454-3d1b-4e95-b697-1af015a5a20f" .
