<http://data.gov.be/dataset/brussels/ded27b96-d74b-4db7-a13c-84a6105497be> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Brussels-Capital Region : location of groundwater catchment sites protection areas 2 and 3 (i.e. extraction wells and drainage gallery) in the Brussels-Capital Region. Those sites were defined in the Brussels-Capital Government decree of 19 September 2002 delimiting a groundwater catchments protection area at the “Bois de la Cambre” and in the Sonian Forest (Belgian Monitor: June 10, 2008)"@en .
