<http://data.gov.be/dataset/brussels/3a62f9f9-4a3f-433f-9364-3787a0fc6760> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The geological model BRUSTRATI3D v1.1 is a set of raster files covering the Brussels-Capital Region. These files contain the roof elevations and the thicknesses of the Stratigraphic Units (SU/BCR) and the Digital Terrain Model (DTM) of the topographic surface used in this model. These rasters have a 10x10m resolution and their reference coordinate system is EPSG 31370 Belgian Lambert 31370.\n\nThe documentation relating to the construction oh these data is available at the following addresses (French only) :\n\n###BRUSTRATI3D V1.1\nhttp://document.environnement.brussels/opac_css/index.php?lvl=notice_display&id=10965\n\n###BRUSTRATI3D V1.0\nhttp://document.environnement.brussels/opac_css/index.php?lvl=notice_display&id=10964"@en .
