<http://data.gov.be/dataset/brussels/f03544a1-a01c-4374-b19d-e93697f1ac73> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The purpose of the barometer of overnights is to give a monthly view on the bednights spent by tourists in Brussels. It gives a total view of the bednights by month and splits them by purpose of the trip (leisure / professional), by type of accomodation and by country of origin of tourists. The data comes from the National Statistics Office who collects them from hotels in Brussels"@en .
